<span class="eyebrow reveal">Why now</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">Why Data Analytics, and <span class="serif">why now.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">Every company now runs on dashboards, and someone has to build them. Analytics is the widest door into tech for non-coders: the tools are learnable in months, the demand spans every industry, and AI has made analysts more valuable, not less.</p>
<div class="why-stats">
<div class="ws reveal"><b>No.1</b><span class="t">Entry route into tech</span><p>The most accessible high-paying tech role for commerce and science graduates alike.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>11M+</b><span class="t">Data jobs by 2026</span><p>India remains one of the largest analytics job markets in the world.</p></div>
